   * Sign-in button is present but not yet wired to the backend login API.

2. Purpose of This Modification:

   * Phase 1 requires the “Sign in” nav item and `/auth` route to render a real screen.
   * Prepares the UI shell for Phase 2 when `POST /api/v1/auth/login` will be integrated.

3. How This Modification Is Involved in the Flow:

   * Registered at `/auth` in `app_router.dart`.
   * Opened from header “Sign in”, “MY KMC” nav items, and mobile drawer.
   * Future flow: user enters credentials → API login → redirect to member dashboard (Phase 2).
